# Gitignored files Orca copies (not symlinks) into every new worktree.
# Literal paths only; blank lines and # comments are ignored.
#
# Intentionally empty. Do not add:
#   .env             - holds PUBER_CLIENT_SECRET, TMDB_READ_ACCESS_TOKEN,
#                      STOREPASS and RELEASE_KEYSTORE_BASE64. Task worktrees
#                      must never carry credentials.
#   local.properties - the README documents it as a second home for the same
#                      secrets. scripts.setup in orca.yaml writes sdk.dir only.
#
# A worktree build therefore ships an empty CLIENT_SECRET and cannot complete a
# fresh login. Smoke still installs the worktree's own APK, preserving app data
# through tools/android-apk-install-preserve.
